msgid "Judge every conflict in the list and count the result per mod, rather than per record.\n\nA flat list of conflicts cannot answer the question that decides load order: which of my mods is losing work? This compares each record field by field and counts, for every plugin, how many records it edits and does not get its way on.\n\nReads every conflicting record with tes3conv, so it takes a moment on a large load order. Read-only."
